<title>USA: Harleysville boosts qtly div to $0.22/shr.</title>
<headline>Harleysville boosts qtly div to $0.22/shr.</headline>
<dateline>HARLEYSVILLE, Pa. 1997-02-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Harleysville National Corp Friday declared a regular quarterly cash dividend of $0.22 per share, a 15.8 percent increase over the regular dividend paid a year ago.</p>
<p>The dividend is payable March 31, 1997, to shareholders of record March 14, 1997.</p>
<p>Harleysville National is a bank holding company.</p>
